{"suttaId":"tha-ap214","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7620,7635],"vripara":"6"},"segments":{"tha-ap214:0.3":"Pānadhidāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap214:1.1":"“Āraññikassa isino, cirarattatapassino [jhāyino, mettacittatapassino (syā.)];","tha-ap214:1.3":"Buddhassa [dhammassa (syā. ka.)] bhāvitattassa, adāsiṃ pānadhiṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap214:2.1":"“Tena kammena dvipadinda, lokajeṭṭha narāsabha;","tha-ap214:2.3":"Dibbayānaṃ [sabbaṃ yānaṃ (sī.)] anubhomi, pubbakammassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap214:3.1":"“Catunnavute ito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap214:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pānadhissa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap214:4.1":"“Sattasattatito kappe, aṭṭha āsiṃsu khattiyā;","tha-ap214:4.3":"Suyānā nāma nāmena, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap214:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap214:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pānadhidāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap214:7.1":"Pānadhidāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
